chronochromatic.org

The code — the pages, stalk.js, chroma-ui.js, glossary.js, serve.py and the
tools — is offered under the MIT licence, below.

The writing and the figures are offered under CC BY 4.0: use them, change them,
put them in a paper or a lecture, commercially or not, provided you say where
they came from.

This is here because the site spends a page naming everyone it borrowed from,
and it would be strange to be careful about that and silent about its own
terms. Very little of the mathematics is original in any case — see
Inspirations for the accounting.

